# graphify knowledge graph — track the portable outputs (overrides the global
# ~/.gitignore_global rule that excludes graphify-out/). Skip the regenerated AST
# cache, the ever-growing dated snapshots, the bulky HTML viewer, per-run cost
# telemetry, and machine-specific metadata (.graphify_root holds an absolute path).
!graphify-out/
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/????-??-??/
graphify-out/graph.html
graphify-out/cost.json
graphify-out/.graphify_*
